    "name": "Tales of Sintra: The Dark Vortex",
    "steam_appid": 2285640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Sintra: The Dark Vortex</i> is a VR action-adventure with physical combat, exploration, and puzzles set in a dark and magical world on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Physical combat and progression without menus</strong><br>Wield two swords, a shield, and a bow. Learn to fight with realistic mechanics while unlocking new powers and upgrades \u2014 all without traditional HUDs or inventories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Exploration and puzzles</strong><br>Traverse dungeons, castles, temples, and ancient fortresses while solving environmental puzzles that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spells and ancient guardians</strong><br>Defeat powerful guardians to obtain legendary spells and enchant your weapons to reach new areas and face tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Designed for PCVR</strong><br>This version features enhanced graphics compared to the Quest edition \u2014 with improved lighting, draw distance, and textures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>A complete VR experience</strong><br>No microtransactions, no cut content. A full adventure of 6 to 8 hours of immersive VR gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Sintra: The Dark Vortex</i> is a VR action-adventure with physical combat, exploration, and puzzles set in a dark and magical world on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Physical combat and progression without menus</strong><br>Wield two swords, a shield, and a bow. Learn to fight with realistic mechanics while unlocking new powers and upgrades \u2014 all without traditional HUDs or inventories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Exploration and puzzles</strong><br>Traverse dungeons, castles, temples, and ancient fortresses while solving environmental puzzles that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spells and ancient guardians</strong><br>Defeat powerful guardians to obtain legendary spells and enchant your weapons to reach new areas and face tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Designed for PCVR</strong><br>This version features enhanced graphics compared to the Quest edition \u2014 with improved lighting, draw distance, and textures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>A complete VR experience</strong><br>No microtransactions, no cut content. A full adventure of 6 to 8 hours of immersive VR gameplay.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tales of Sintra is a VR action-adventure with sword, shield, and bow combat. Explore ancient ruins, solve puzzles, and face the Dark Vortex in this upgraded PCVR version with enhanced visuals.",
